msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,term:"
msgid ""
"Term to adjust (for a graduated rent: the base term, step 0). Only terms of "
"this contract are offered whose contract type and term type both allow the "
"procedure."
msgstr ""
"Anzupassende Kondition (bei einer Staffelmiete die Bezugskondition, Stufe 0)."
" Angeboten werden nur Konditionen dieses Vertrags, deren Vertragsart und "
"Konditionsart das Verfahren zulassen."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,valid_from:"
msgid ""
"Date from which the adjustment applies - for a graduated rent the start of "
"the base term."
msgstr ""
"Datum, ab dem die Anpassung gilt – bei einer Staffelmiete der Beginn der "
"Bezugskondition."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,rhythm_months:"
msgid ""
"Months between two steps - at least 12 (§ 557a para. 2 BGB: the rent has to "
"remain unchanged for at least one year)."
msgstr ""
"Monate zwischen zwei Staffeln – mindestens 12 (§ 557a Abs. 2 BGB: die Miete "
"muss mindestens ein Jahr unverändert bleiben)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,increase_mode:"
msgid ""
"Only a calculation aid: every step stores exactly one amount (net, per rhythm"
" period, rounded to the cent)."
msgstr ""
"Nur Rechenhilfe: Jede Staffel speichert genau einen Betrag (netto, je "
"Rhythmusperiode, auf Cent gerundet)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,increase_value:"
msgid ""
"Absolute Amount: amount per period. Amount per Area: amount per m² and "
"period. Percentage: percent."
msgstr ""
"Absoluter Betrag: Betrag je Periode. Betrag je Fläche: Betrag je m² und "
"Periode. Prozent: Prozentwert."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,percent_basis:"
msgid ""
"Base Amount: same increase for all steps. Previous Step: each step is "
"calculated from the previous one (compound)."
msgstr ""
"Ausgangsbetrag: gleiche Erhöhung für alle Staffeln. Vorstufe: jede Staffel "
"wird von der vorherigen aus berechnet (Zinseszins)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,generated_area:"
msgid "Area fixed when generating (part of the agreement)."
msgstr "Beim Generieren festgeschriebene Fläche (Teil der Vereinbarung)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,area:"
msgid ""
"Area of the base term's informative measurement as of its start - fixed when "
"generating."
msgstr ""
"Fläche der informativen Bemessung der Bezugskondition zu deren Beginn – wird "
"beim Generieren festgeschrieben."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,base_amount:"
msgid "Net amount of the base term (quantity × unit price)."
msgstr "Nettobetrag der Bezugskondition (Menge × Einzelpreis)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,increase_percent:"
msgid "Information only."
msgstr "Nur zur Information."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,total_increase_percent:"
msgid "Information only."
msgstr "Nur zur Information."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,base_valid_to_orig:"
msgid ""
"'Valid to' of the base term before generating - restored on reset, taken over"
" by the last step."
msgstr ""
"„Gültig bis“ der Bezugskondition vor dem Generieren – wird beim Zurücksetzen "
"wiederhergestellt und von der letzten Staffel übernommen."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,agreement_date:"
msgid ""
"Date of the agreement (graduated or index rent) resp. of the adjustment "
"declaration."
msgstr ""
"Datum der Vereinbarung (Staffel- oder Indexmiete) bzw. der "
"Anpassungserklärung."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,written_form:"
msgid ""
"The agreement was made in writing (§ 557a para. 1 BGB for a graduated rent, "
"mandatory for residential contracts)."
msgstr ""
"Die Vereinbarung wurde schriftlich getroffen (bei Staffelmiete § 557a Abs. 1 "
"BGB, bei Wohnraum Pflicht)."

msgctxt "help:real_estate.contract.rent_adjustment,termination_waiver_until:"
msgid ""
"Tenant's waiver of termination until - at most 4 years after the agreement (§"
" 557a para. 3 BGB)."
msgstr ""
"Kündigungsverzicht des Mieters bis – höchstens 4 Jahre nach der Vereinbarung "
"(§ 557a Abs. 3 BGB)."

